{"version":"1.5.0-alpha.3","notes":"## 1.5.0-alpha.3 - 2026-10-25\n\n### Features\n\n- View file receiving results in history details, retry only failed files without downloading saved files again, and cancel ongoing receives (#2108)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fix synchronization failures on some networks (#2108)\n- Fix Docker deployments incorrectly appearing unhealthy and preventing startup of remote access (#2113)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 1.5.0-alpha.3 - 2026-10-25\n\n### Features\n\n- 在历史记录详情中查看文件接收结果，仅重试失败的文件而无需重新下载已保存的文件，并可取消正在进行的接收 (#2108)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复部分网络环境下同步失败的问题 (#2108)\n- 修复 Docker 部署被误判为不健康、导致远程访问无法启动的问题 (#2113)","confirmation_required":false,"confirmation_description":null,"pub_date":"2026-10-25T12:26:06Z","platforms":{"linux-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0-alpha.3/UniClipboard_1.5.0-alpha.3_aarch64.AppImage.tar.gz"},"linux-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0-alpha.3/UniClipboard_1.5.0-alpha.3_amd64.AppImage.tar.gz"},"windows-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0-alpha.3/UniClipboard_1.5.0-alpha.3_arm64-setup.exe"},"windows-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0-alpha.3/UniClipboard_1.5.0-alpha.3_x64-setup.exe"},"darwin-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0-alpha.3/UniClipboard_aarch64-apple-darwin.app.tar.gz"},"darwin-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.5.0-alpha.3/UniClipboard_x86_64-apple-darwin.app.tar.gz"}}}